Output scene1.mp4
Source common.tape
Set FontSize 19
Set Width 1616
Set Height 812
Set Framerate 30
Source setup.tape
Show
Sleep 500ms
Type "testdash"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 2.2s
Down@150ms
Left@150ms
Down@150ms
Left@150ms
Down@150ms
Left@150ms
Down
Sleep 300ms
Space
Sleep 600ms
Down@90ms 9
Space@250ms 3
Sleep 700ms
Type "/"
Type@90ms "refund"
Sleep 1.1s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
